{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_zn4tqvin6ps5kqzdreccearxhjqb3kjxu73b6a53ps3i7norfqua","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01CXSwdrBtujKzCTEdM9n5hD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='CONFIGS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"8. **stdio state**: total output below / above a 4096-byte `st_blksize` block\n   (glibc only writes whole blocks, so this decides how much survives a crash),\n   and the three ways the program ends: `exit(0)` via `exit|quit`, `fgets`\n   returning NULL (EOF), and death by `SIGSEGV`.\"\"\",\"\"\"8. **stdio state**: total output below / above a 4096-byte `st_blksize` block\n   (glibc only writes whole blocks, so this decides how much survives a crash),\n   the buffering *mode* glibc picks for the stream (fully buffered pipe/file vs\n   line-buffered terminal, plus the line-buffer flush glibc performs before\n   reading from an interactive stdin), and the three ways the program ends:\n   `exit(0)` via `exit|quit`, `fgets` returning NULL (EOF), and death by\n   `SIGSEGV`.\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"| C50 | `login`,`logout`,`whoami`,`createfile` | login state built on an overflow-corrupted `logged_in`/`current_user` (still inside the mapping): `logout`, `whoami`, `createfile` on that state | [x] |\"\"\",\"\"\"| C50 | `login`,`logout`,`whoami`,`createfile` | login state built on an overflow-corrupted `logged_in`/`current_user` (still inside the mapping): `logout`, `whoami`, `createfile` on that state | [x] |\n| C51 | *program* | stdio buffering mode: stdout/stdin as pipe vs pseudo-terminal (all 4 combinations), with and without a `SIGSEGV` — line buffering makes far more output survive a crash, and glibc flushes line-buffered stdout before reading from a tty stdin but does *not* flush a fully buffered one | [x] |\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPY\ngrep -c \"^| C\" CONFIGS.md; timeout 600 cargo test --offline 2>&1 | grep -E \"result:\"","description":"Document C51 and run the full suite"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1726,"cache_read_input_tokens":277956,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1726,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8414a394-b54a-4582-aae8-c81f9c4a1ffc","uuid":"c1aef7ea-1ca3-4537-8b7c-df100181ab4d","timestamp":"2026-08-20T00:07:42.675Z"}
