w `users` are *not* immediately fatal (they land in padding — `.got.plt`/`.dynamic`/`stdin` clobbers fail later instead), and glibc line-buffers a terminal (all four stdin/stdout pipe-vs-tty combinations now match, including crash cases).\n\n## Completion gate\n\n- **`SYMBOLS.md`** — `nm -D` diff is one symbol: `stdin@GLIBC_2.2.5`, a glibc *copy relocation* (not `main.c` code); all 26 `main.c` functions have Rust counterparts (asserted in `d04`). No C source was left untranslated.\n- **`CONFIGS.md`** — 51/51 rows pass, randomized with fixed seeds.\n- **`ERRORS.md`** — 62 explicit rejections + 11 UB rejections, all with tests that also assert the reference binary really emitted that message/status.\n- **Every configuration** — `Cargo.toml` has no `[features]`; default / `--no-default-features` / `--all-features` and the release profile (`panic = \"abort\"`) all pass (`./verify.sh`).\n\nConfidence checks: 4500+ extra randomized cases (including uniformly random byte streams) diverged 0 times, and the harness was mutation-tested — a changed message, wrong block size, `-1/0/+1` `strcmp` convention, cached counter, wrong mapping size, and a `fgets` off-by-one each made the suite fail, so the tests aren't vacuous. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified (checksums unchanged; only `c_src/build/` was added)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1616,"cache_read_input_tokens":295367,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1616,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8414a394-b54a-4582-aae8-c81f9c4a1ffc","uuid":"2752dc2e-423c-47e1-a606-36803acb3a21","timestamp":"2026-08-20T00:15:03.981Z"}
